<title>USA: NYNEX accepts NY commission's merger terms.</title>
<headline>NYNEX accepts NY commission's merger terms.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>NYNEX Corp said on Monday it would accept the conditions set forth by the New York State Public Service Commission last week when it gave its qualified approval for NYNEX to merge with Bell Atlantic Corp.</p>
</text>
